Do not buy this game in hopes that it's like Zoo Tycoon.
I did not play this nearly enough time to make a full fledged review simply because the game ran terribly slow, however I can pin point afew first look cons and pros.
Pros:
- Animal Variety;
- Decent graphics on the animal models;
- Alot of in game depth about animal care.
Cons:
- Game runs slow;
- UI is terribly optimized;
- Minimap is reversed;
- User unfriendly start.
As for the price, I think it's very accessible if you have some patience to learn how to properly build in this game, there is tons of content to sink quite afew hours in.

